uplink-autosurgeon-anti-drop-name = Anti-Drop Implant Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-anti-drop-desc = This implant lets you lock your grip on held items so you keep them even when stunned. Comes with a one-use autosurgeon for installation.
uplink-autosurgeon-cns-rebooter-name = CNS Rebooter Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-cns-rebooter-desc = This implant will help you get back up on your feet faster after being stunned. Comes with a one-use autosurgeon for installation.
uplink-autosurgeon-reviver-name = Reviver Autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-reviver-desc = This implant will attempt to heal you out of critical condition, and can even bring you back from death. Comes with a one-use autosurgeon for installation.
uplink-autosurgeon-upgraded-herculean-name = Upgraded Herculean autosurgeon
uplink-autosurgeon-upgraded-herculean-desc = Installs an upgraded Herculean spinal implant. Upgrading it to Atlas requires a gravity anomaly core.
